# ── ModelSim project / simulation artifacts ──────────────────────
# The whole modelsim/ folder is regenerated locally on every run —
# none of it is source, so none of it belongs in version control.
modelsim/

# Named explicitly too, in case these ever end up outside modelsim/
newProPro.mpf
newProPro.cr.mti

# ── Catch-all in case any of these get created outside modelsim/ ──
work/
*.wlf
*.vstf
*.mti
*.mpf
transcript
*.ucdb
*.log

# ── GHDL artifacts (if you ever simulate with GHDL too) ───────────
*.cf
*.o
*.vcd
*.ghw

# ── OS / editor junk ────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.vscode/